  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards Durable Solution in Greater Malakal, Upper Nile State, South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the proposed project is to support an enabling environment for durable solutions for displacement-affected populations in and around Malakal, including Malakal Protection of Civilians (PoC) residents, new arrivals from Sudan, and communities hosting internally displaced persons (IDPs) in Malakal Town and Fashoda (Kodok).</narrative>
  </description>
